# Improvisation Capstone's paradigm (CR 702.170a): the Capstone is exiled as it resolves on turn 1 (after exiling four Bolts and
# casting none of them), and at the beginning of Bot1's first main phase on turn 3 the copy cast from exile for free digs
# again - four more Bolts, one cast at Bot2 (20 - 3 = 17). On turn 5 the copy is declined: no dig, the library keeps its
# cards and Bot2 stays at 17. The card is in exile all along (8 exiled: the Capstone, the 4 of the first dig, 3 left of the second).

